# Card Jira → Test Queue (NONAKTIF)

**TC hanya di Jira sejak 22-10-2026.** File `TC-*.md` lama = **arsip read-only** — jangan dibuat/diubah.
`test-queue.yaml` di root repo juga **arsip read-only** (terakhir disinkron 2026-08-14 / diubah 18-10-2026) — jangan create/update/hapus.
Trigger `#card-tc` **tidak dipakai lagi**; jangan menulis antrian atau file TC dari card Jira.

**Pengganti:**

- Menjalankan test card / TC → skill `.cursor/skills/olshoperp-card-testing/SKILL.md`.
- Membuat card Test Case → skill `.cursor/skills/olshoperp-testcase-authoring/SKILL.md`.
- Re-OPEN / defect → `22-reopen-defect-flow.mdc`.

**Site Jira (WAJIB):** hanya **ETM** di `https://erpintegration.atlassian.net` — `cloudId` `44cc9820-3372-4c12-884c-698b1397173c`. MCP Rovo melihat dua org; **jangan** `eduqat.atlassian.net`. Setiap JQL/create/get **wajib** `cloudId` ETM. Detail di `olshoperp/.cursor/rules/16-jira-etm-site.mdc`.
